# A loop costs the same wherever it stands: at the top level of a module, the way a first benchmark is written, and in a function that is called once.
# What a turn takes: calls into the run time, and instructions by the counter of the hardware, where that can be read. The file beside this one has the other place.
# -- source: main.ts
